        "original_id": "d0c95c1a-ae87-5bba-91fc-1b29ec6d1d62",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sam Wood, Robert Taylor, John Hodiak, Arlene Dahl, Luke Short\n- Works: Ambush (1950 film), \"Ambush\" serial story\n- Organizations: Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer, The Saturday Evening Post\n- Topics: Western films, film adaptation, acting careers\n\nFacts:\n- The Saturday Evening Post published Luke Short's serial story \"Ambush\" from 25 December 1948 to 12 February 1949.\n- Ambush is a 1950 western film directed by Sam Wood.\n- Ambush stars Robert Taylor, John Hodiak, and Arlene Dahl.\n- The plot of Ambush is based on Luke Short's serial story \"Ambush.\"\n- Arlene Carol Dahl was born on August 11, 1925.\n- Arlene Dahl is an American actress and a former Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer contract star.\n- Arlene Dahl achieved notability during the 1950s.",
